        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "Asthma The safety and effectiveness of FASENRA for add-on maintenance treatment of patients with severe asthma and with an eosinophilic phenotype have been established in pediatric patients 6 years and older.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-fasenra",
